@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Session State Machine Diagram</b></size>\n<size:12>Session Lifecycle and Processing States</size>

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #334155
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4

state "IDLE" as Idle #DBEAFE : System ready for new session\nESP32 Status LED: OFF

state "WAITING_FOR_START" as Waiting #E0F2FE : Session initialized via API/Bridge\nAwaiting capture trigger

state "RECORDING" as Recording #BFDBFE : INMP441 actively capturing 16kHz PCM\nESP32 Status LED: ON (GPIO4)

state "AUDIO_READY" as AudioReady #DDD6FE : Audio captured/uploaded and validated\nPCM/WAV available for processing

state "ANALYZING" as Analyzing #C4B5FD : 3-second sliding windows (1s hop)\nHuBERT-D inference & event aggregation

state "ANALYZED" as Analyzed #DCFCE7 : Session summary & metrics stored in SQLite\nAvailable for Streamlit review

[*] --> Idle

' Hardware Workflow Path
Idle --> Waiting : POST /api/v1/session/start\n(Hardware capture workflow)
Waiting --> Recording : Physical START button (GPIO27)\nor Serial START command
Recording --> AudioReady : Physical STOP button (GPIO33)\nor 60-second limit reached

' WAV Upload Path (Direct)
Idle --> AudioReady : WAV session uploaded\n(Fallback / testing path)

' Common Analysis & Review Path
AudioReady --> Analyzing : POST /api/v1/session/<id>/analyze\nor dashboard trigger
Analyzing --> Analyzed : Inference complete, thresholds applied,\nevents clustered & summary persisted
Analyzed --> Idle : Review complete / New session

Idle --> [*]

note right of Analyzed
  <b>Database Lifecycle Statuses:</b>
  SQLite tracks backend status as:
  • <b>STARTED</b> (Session created)
  • <b>STOPPED</b> (Audio received)
  • <b>ANALYZED</b> (Results ready)
end note

@enduml